More efficient data storage for TopoCaloNoisyCells.

Hold noise data as a vector rather than as an unordered_map,
using the indexing service.
This is both faster and takes less space.
Store the data in CaloCellConstantsSvc to avoid duplication in configurations
where this tool is configured multiple times.
